bK5gt7LHnDjCfZnAGuK0ig","review_id":"HN5Fw-2kH7eJia6sCpcTfg","date":"2021-01-21T17:22:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9380381107330322,"text_excerpt":"I love this place and it will become a staple. I really like their iced matcha latte. Just sweet enough, but not too sweet. I also had a ham and cheese croissant that they warmed up for me and it was perfect for a breakfast snack. The barista was so friendly and made my experience! They had a few tables outside and some limited indoor seating. Please give this place a chance!"},{"business_id":"bK5gt7LHnDjCfZnAGuK0ig","review_id":"CzmOSXMAKzzWK3x34_MVSA","date":"2021-02-07T01:33:59","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9360882043838501,"text_excerpt":"I had a king cake iced latte at Park Island Brew this morning and loved it! How have I never been here before? They're located across the street from the Fairgrounds and parking was a breeze. This spot is so cool. From the actual building to the bright interior and delicious java, it just embodies a New Orleans coffee experience. The staff was friendly and knowledgeable of their menu. I also picked up a couple of baked goods - another big win. I'm looking forward to my next latte."},{"business_id":"bK5gt7LHnDjCfZnAGuK0ig","review_id":"5DPlAu4hu9U0zcVMjl3V0Q","date":"2020-12-01T02:43:29","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9281891584396362,"text_excerpt":"I love this place! I'm already obsessed! Customer Service and Atmosphere. The service is impeccable. I have already been over 7 times and I had a great experience each time with the staff. The staff is friendly, helpful and I love that they give recommendations once they get to know you. It's a really good experience. They are also very responsive on social media. The atmosphere is also very cute! It's a bright location with a good amount of seating. They are following all COVID protocol. Mask is of course required and two hand sanitizing stations are available for patrons. Btw the hand sanitizer is high quality. Also, they have an award system! Drinks. So far, I only have tried the drink..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"bK5gt7LHnDjCfZnAGuK0ig","photo_id":"R_kOZvITUFMSjIAkyK49Pw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/R_kOZvITUFMSjIAkyK49Pw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9021463990211487},{"business_id":"bK5gt7LHnDjCfZnAGuK0ig","photo_id":"UW2SkR6MxAOMnTu88Ms91A","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/UW2SkR6MxAOMnTu88Ms91A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9021463990211487}]},"notebook_case":null}
